    text masha_name "Masha" #8f887c x 150 y 340 font_size 32 hidden true
    icon tom size 140 set twemoji x 850 y 450 or ["person"] icon_look picture of man hidden true
    text tom_name "Tom" #8f887c x 850 y 340 font_size 32 hidden true
    icon balloon_t size 90 set twemoji x 720 y 330 or ["right anger bubble"] icon_look picture of "speech balloon" hidden true
    icon balloon size 90 set twemoji x 290 y 330 or ["right anger bubble"] icon_look picture of "speech balloon" hidden true
    dialogue talk speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"b","text":"Том, приве́т! Ты прие́хал!","gloss":"Tom, hi! You've come!"},{"by":"a","text":"Приве́т! Обы́чно я хожу́ к тебе́, а сего́дня прие́хал на маши́не.","gloss":"Hi! I usually walk to yours, but today I came by car."},{"by":"b","text":"А где Ива́н?","gloss":"And where's Ivan?"},{"by":"a","text":"Он был на рабо́те, а пото́м ушёл домо́й.","gloss":"He was at work, and then he went home."},{"by":"b","text":"Хорошо́. Кот, ты куда́?","gloss":"OK. Cat, where are you off to?"},{"by":"a","text":"Он вы́шел на у́лицу!","gloss":"He's gone out into the street!"}] practice true size 1.6 hidden true
    icon q_walk size 150 set twemoji x 380 y 470 or ["person walking"] icon_look picture of "man walking" hidden true
    icon q_home size 170 set twemoji x 640 y 470 or ["house with garden"] icon_look picture of house hidden true
    icon q_car size 150 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["automobile"] icon_look picture of "oncoming automobile" hidden true
    icon q_away size 110 set twemoji x 700 y 470 or ["rightwards arrow"] icon_look picture of "right arrow" hidden true
    icon q_carhome size 150 set twemoji x 300 y 470 or ["house with garden"] icon_look picture of house hidden true
    icon q_shop size 170 set twemoji x 640 y 470 or ["department store","shopping cart"] icon_look picture of "convenience store" hidden true
    icon q_man size 150 set twemoji x 380 y 470 or ["person walking"] icon_look picture of "man walking" hidden true
    icon q_carsay size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["red car"] icon_look picture of automobile hidden true
    text q_say "Я прие́хал на маши́не." say "Я прие́хал на маши́не." colors {"^при":"#17808a"} x 500 y 300 font_size 60 hidden true
    icon q_w2 size 150 set twemoji x 380 y 470 or ["person walking"] icon_look picture of "woman walking" hidden true
    icon q_home2 size 170 set twemoji x 640 y 470 or ["house with garden"] icon_look picture of house hidden true
    icon end_tom size 150 set twemoji x 360 y 470 or ["person walking"] icon_look picture of "man walking" hidden true
    icon end_home size 160 set twemoji x 640 y 470 or ["house with garden"] icon_look picture of house hidden true
    text end_say "Я иду́ домо́й. Пока́!" say "Я иду́ домо́й. Пока́!" x 500 y 290 font_size 60 hidden true

A: Tom is on his way to Masha's: Том идёт к Ма́ше. But how do you say he has got there?
    draw house tom_w t1

    erase t1

B: (@draw t2@) Том пришёл!
    move tom_w to.x 360 to.y 330 duration 1.2

A: Пришёл is шёл, from lesson thirty-one, with при in front.
    draw r_sh

A: При means arriving: he walked, and he got here.
    highlight r_sh color #17808a part ^при

A: For a woman, as always, шла: Ма́ша пришла́.
    draw r_shla

    erase r_sh r_shla t2 tom_w

B: Том прие́хал на маши́не.
    draw car t3

A: With wheels, put при on е́хал: прие́хал.
    draw r_eh

A: So the front of the verb says which way, and the rest says how. Four of these fronts today.
    highlight r_eh color #c9871a effect underline

    erase car t3 r_eh

A: При comes up to the door. Its opposite is у, away: (@draw w_pri2 w_u2@) ушёл, уе́хал, and she left is ушла́.
    draw a_pri w_pri a_u w_u

B: Ива́н ушёл домо́й.
    draw t_ivan

A: Домо́й is home, as the place you go to. It answers куда́, like в Москву́.
    highlight t_ivan color #c9871a part домо́й effect underline

    erase t_ivan

B: Том вошёл в дом.
    draw a_v w_v t_tomv

A: В, as in в дом, means in: вошёл, he went in. An о slips in, to make it easy to say.
    highlight w_v color #17808a part ^во

    erase t_tomv

B: Кот вы́шел на у́лицу.
    draw a_vy w_vy cat_d t_cat

A: And вы is out. In these done verbs, вы always takes the stress: вы́шел, вы́шла.
    highlight w_vy color #17808a part ^вы

    erase t_cat cat_d

A: Вчера́ я ходи́л в кино́.
    draw t_hod

A: Ходи́л was a round trip, there and back. Пришёл is done, like прочита́л: he came, and he's still here.
    highlight t_hod color #c9871a part ходи́л effect underline

    erase t_hod

    hide board house

A: Now just listen. Tom asks Masha where her dad is.
    draw masha masha_name tom tom_name

A: Ма́ша, где па́па?
    draw balloon_t caption false

    erase balloon_t

B: Он ушёл на рабо́ту.
    draw balloon caption false

    ask "Where is he?" listen "Он ушёл на рабо́ту." voice b gloss "He's gone to work." options ["At home.","Gone to work.","Just got home."] correct 2
        right: Gone to work: ушёл на рабо́ту.
        wrong: Listen for the front of the verb: у, away.

    erase balloon

A: On Saturday Tom comes to Masha's. Listen, then practise it.

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    erase talk

    hide masha masha_name tom tom_name

    quiz "Tom walked to Masha's and got there at seven. Том ___ к Ма́ше в семь часо́в." reveal.text "Том пришёл к Ма́ше." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: Пришёл: при for arriving, шёл for on foot.
        wrong: He got there: which front means arriving?
        * ушёл
        * вы́шел
        + пришёл

    draw q_home q_walk

    pause 1.5

    erase q_home q_walk question_2_stamp

    quiz "Masha drove away. Which is right?" reveal.text "Ма́ша уе́хала." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Уе́хала: у for away, е́хала for wheels, and а for her.
        wrong: Away is у; by car is е́хать.
        + Ма́ша уе́хала.
        * Ма́ша ушла́.
        * Ма́ша прие́хала.

    draw q_carhome q_car q_away

    pause 1.5

    erase q_carhome q_car q_away question_3_stamp

    quiz "He went into the shop. Он ___ в магази́н." reveal.text "Он вошёл в магази́н." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: Вошёл: в for in, with an о to say it easily.
        wrong: Into is в.
        * вы́шел
        + вошёл
        * ушёл

    draw q_shop q_man

    pause 1.5

    erase q_shop q_man question_4_stamp

    draw q_carsay

    ask "Tell Masha you came by car. A woman says прие́хала." say_it "Я прие́хал на маши́не." gloss "I came by car." voice a show cue test t1

A: Я прие́хал на маши́не.
    draw q_say

    erase q_carsay q_say

    ask "Now build a sentence. Type: Masha came home." answer ["маша пришла домой","пришла домой","она пришла домой","маша приехала домой","приехала домой","она приехала домой"] reveal.text "Ма́ша пришла́ домо́й." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        keys "АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ "
        right: Ма́ша пришла́ домо́й, or прие́хала if she drove: при for arriving, а for her, and домо́й for where to.
        wrong: Start with Ма́ша, then при on шла, then home as the place you go to: домо́й.

    draw q_home2 q_w2

    pause 1.5

    erase q_home2 q_w2 question_6_stamp

    show house board

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

A: So the front of a going verb points the way: при to, у away, в in, вы out. Шёл or е́хал tells how you went.
    highlight w_pri w_u w_v w_vy color #c9871a effect underline

    hide board house

A: Я иду́ домо́й. Пока́!
    draw end_home end_tom end_say

    erase end_home end_tom end_say

B: Next time: the future of done, я прочита́ю.
    box next65 "Next: lesson 65 · я прочита́ю" say "я прочита́ю" x 500 y 430 width 640 height 130 radius 14 font_size 44

